  "integrationChanges": [
    "EmbeddedShellMain owner is local.cleartv.mobile; provider still enforces shell/root UID.",
    "Internal activity declarations; no extra launcher icon.",
    "Pairing does not install or launch a second Samsung app: open the built-in Launcher receiver, or use the explicit TV installation page.",
